\v 17 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [when]{strong=“G1097” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [knew]{strong=“G1097” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} it, [he saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 5”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 6”}, \wj Why reason ye, because ye have no bread? perceive ye not yet, neither understand? have ye your heart yet hardened?\wj* 
