\v 19 \wj When I brake the five loaves among five thousand, how many baskets full of fragments took ye up?\wj* [They say]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3P 14”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 15”}, [Twelve]{strong=“G1427” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 16”}. 
