\v 37 \wj Whosoever shall receive one of such children in my name, receiveth me: and whosoever shall receive me, receiveth not me, but him that sent me.\wj* 
\p
\v 38 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [John]{strong=“G3588 G2491” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 4 5”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 1”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 3”}, [saying]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 6”}, [Master]{strong=“G1320” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Vsm\sc* 7”}, [we saw]{strong=“G1492” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-1P 8”} [one]{strong=“G5100” x-morph=“robinson: X-\sc Asm\sc* 9”} [casting out]{strong=“G1544” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Asm\sc* 13”} [devils]{strong=“G1140” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Apn\sc* 14”} [in]{strong=“G3588 G3686” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsn\sc* 10 11”} [thy]{strong=“G4675” x-morph=“robinson: P-2\sc Gs\sc* 12”} [name]{strong=“G3686” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Dsn\sc* 11”}, [and he]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Nsm\sc* 15”} [followeth]{strong=“G190” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 17”} [not]{strong=“G3756” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prt\sc*-N 16”} [us]{strong=“G2254” x-morph=“robinson: P-1\sc Dp\sc* 18”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 19”} [we forbad]{strong=“G2967” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-1P 20”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 21”}, [because]{strong=“G3754” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 22”} [he followeth]{strong=“G190” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 24”} [not]{strong=“G3756” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prt\sc*-N 23”} [us]{strong=“G2254” x-morph=“robinson: P-1\sc Dp\sc* 25”}. 
\v 39 [But]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 4”}, \wj Forbid him not: for there is no man which shall do a miracle in my name, that can lightly speak evil of me.\wj* 
\v 40 \wj For he that is not against us is on our part.\wj* 
\v 41 \wj For whosoever shall give you a cup of water to drink in my name, because ye belong to Christ, verily I say unto you, he shall not lose his reward.\wj* 
\v 42 \wj And whosoever shall offend one of these little ones that believe in me, it is better for him that a millstone were hanged about his neck, and he were cast into the sea.\wj* 
\v 43 \wj And if thy hand offend thee, cut it off: it is better for thee to enter into life maimed, than having two hands to go into hell, into the fire that never shall be quenched:\wj* 
\v 44 \wj Where their worm dieth not, and the fire is not quenched.\wj* 
\v 45 \wj And if thy foot offend thee, cut it off: it is better for thee to enter halt into life, than having two feet to be cast into hell, into the fire that never shall be quenched:\wj* 
\v 46 \wj Where their worm dieth not, and the fire is not quenched.\wj* 
\v 47 \wj And if thine eye offend thee, pluck it out: it is better for thee to enter into the kingdom of God with one eye, than having two eyes to be cast into hell fire:\wj* 
\v 48 \wj Where their worm dieth not, and the fire is not quenched.\wj* 
\v 49 \wj For every one shall be salted with fire, and every sacrifice shall be salted with salt.\wj* 
\v 50 \wj Salt is good: but if the salt have lost his saltness, wherewith will ye season it? Have salt in yourselves, and have peace one with another.\wj* 
\c 10
\p 
\v 1 [And]{strong=“G2547” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc*-C 1”} [he arose]{strong=“G450” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [from thence]{strong=“G2547” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc*-C 1”}, [and cometh]{strong=“G2064” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pni\sc*-3S 3”} [into]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [the coasts]{strong=“G3588 G3725” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Apn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Apn\sc* 5 6”} [of Judæa]{strong=“G3588 G2449” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 7 8”} [by]{strong=“G1223” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 9”} [the farther side]{strong=“G4008” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 11”} [of Jordan]{strong=“G3588 G2446” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 12 13”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 14”} [the people]{strong=“G3793” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 17”} [resort]{strong=“G4848” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pni\sc*-3P 15”} [unto]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 18”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 19”} [again]{strong=“G3825” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 16”}; [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 20”}, [as]{strong=“G5613” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 21”} [he was wont]{strong=“G1486” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Lai\sc*-3S 22”}, [he taught]{strong=“G1321” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 24”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apm\sc* 25”} [again]{strong=“G3825” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 23”}. 
\p
\v 2 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [the Pharisees]{strong=“G3588 G5330” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 3 4”} [came to]{strong=“G4334” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 2”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 6”}, [and asked]{strong=“G1905” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3P 5”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 6”}, [Is it lawful]{strong=“G1832” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pqi\sc*-3S 8”} [for a man]{strong=“G435” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Dsm\sc* 9”} [to put away]{strong=“G630” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aan\sc* 11”} his [wife]{strong=“G1135” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 10”}? [tempting]{strong=“G3985” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 12”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 13”}. 
\v 3 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [and said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 4”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 5”}, \wj What did Moses command you?\wj* 
\v 4 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [they said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3P 3”}, [Moses]{strong=“G3475” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 4”} [suffered]{strong=“G2010” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} [to write]{strong=“G1125” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aan\sc* 8”} [a bill]{strong=“G975” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asn\sc* 6”} [of divorcement]{strong=“G647” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsn\sc* 7”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 9”} [to put her away]{strong=“G630” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aan\sc* 10”}. 
\v 5 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [and said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 6”}, \wj For the hardness of your heart he wrote you this precept.\wj* 
\v 6 \wj But from the beginning of the creation God made them male and female.\wj* 
\v 7 \wj For this cause shall a man leave his father and mother, and cleave to his wife;\wj* 
\v 8 \wj And they twain shall be one flesh: so then they are no more twain, but one flesh.\wj* 
\v 9 \wj What therefore God hath joined together, let not man put asunder.\wj* 
\v 10 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 2”} [the house]{strong=“G3588 G3614” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsf\sc* 3 4”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 8”} [disciples]{strong=“G3588 G3101” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 6 7”} [asked]{strong=“G1905” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3P 12”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 13”} [again]{strong=“G3825” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 5”} [of]{strong=“G4012” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 9”} [the same]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsn\sc* 11”} matter. 
\v 11 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 2”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 3”}, \wj Whosoever shall put away his wife, and marry another, committeth adultery against her.\wj* 
\v 12 \wj And if a woman shall put away her husband, and be married to another, she committeth adultery.\wj* 
\p
\v 13 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [they brought]{strong=“G4374” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 2”} [young children]{strong=“G3813” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Apn\sc* 4”} [to him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 3”}, [that]{strong=“G2443” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 5”} [he should touch]{strong=“G680” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ams\sc*-3S 6”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gpm\sc* 7”}: [and]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 9”} his [disciples]{strong=“G3101” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 10”} [rebuked]{strong=“G2008” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 11”} [those that brought]{strong=“G4374” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Dpm\sc* 13”} them. 
\v 14 [But]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [when]{strong=“G1492” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [saw]{strong=“G1492” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} it, [he was much displeased]{strong=“G23” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 6”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 7”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 8”}, \wj Suffer the little children to come unto me, and forbid them not: for of such is the kingdom of God.\wj* 
\v 15 \wj Verily I say unto you, Whosoever shall not receive the kingdom of God as a little child, he shall not enter therein.\wj* 
\v 16 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he took]{strong=“G1723” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apn\sc* 3”} [up in his arms]{strong=“G1723” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”}, [put]{strong=“G5087” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 4”} his [hands]{strong=“G3588 G5495” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Apf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Apf\sc* 5 6”} [upon]{strong=“G1909” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 7”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apn\sc* 8”}, [and blessed]{strong=“G2127” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 9”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apn\sc* 10”}. 
\p
\v 17 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [when]{strong=“G1607” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pnp\sc*-\sc Gsm\sc* 2”} [he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 3”} [was gone forth]{strong=“G1607” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pnp\sc*-\sc Gsm\sc* 2”} [into]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [the way]{strong=“G3598” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 5”}, [there came]{strong=“G4370” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 6”} [one]{strong=“G1520” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 7”} [running]{strong=“G4370” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 6”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 8”} [kneeled]{strong=“G1120” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 9”} [to him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 10”}, [and asked]{strong=“G1905” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 11”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 12”}, [Good]{strong=“G18” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Vsm\sc* 14”} [Master]{strong=“G1320” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Vsm\sc* 13”}, [what]{strong=“G5101” x-morph=“robinson: I-\sc Asn\sc* 15”} [shall I do]{strong=“G4160” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aas\sc*-1S 16”} [that]{strong=“G2443” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 17”} [I may inherit]{strong=“G2816” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aas\sc*-1S 20”} [eternal]{strong=“G166” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Asf\sc* 19”} [life]{strong=“G2222” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 18”}? 
\v 18 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 4”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 5”}, \wj Why callest thou me good? there is none good but one, that is, God.\wj* 
\v 19 \wj Thou knowest the commandments, Do not commit adultery, Do not kill, Do not steal, Do not bear false witness, Defraud not, Honour thy father and mother.\wj* 
\v 20 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [and said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 4”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 5”}, [Master]{strong=“G1320” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Vsm\sc* 6”}, [all]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Apn\sc* 8”} [these]{strong=“G5023” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Apn\sc* 7”} [have I observed]{strong=“G5442” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ami\sc*-1S 9”} [from]{strong=“G1537” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 10”} [my]{strong=“G3450” x-morph=“robinson: P-1\sc Gs\sc* 12”} [youth]{strong=“G3503” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 11”}. 
\v 21 [Then]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [beholding]{strong=“G1689” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 4”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 5”} [loved]{strong=“G25” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 6”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 7”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 8”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 9”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 10”}, \wj One thing thou lackest: go thy way, sell whatsoever thou hast, and give to the poor, and thou shalt have treasure in heaven: and come, take up the cross, and follow me.\wj* 
\v 22 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he was sad]{strong=“G4768” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [at]{strong=“G1909” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [that saying]{strong=“G3588 G3056” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsm\sc* 5 6”}, [and went away]{strong=“G565” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 7”} [grieved]{strong=“G3076” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ppp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 8”}: [for]{strong=“G1063” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 10”} [he]{strong=“G2258” x-morph=“robinson: V-IXI-3S 9”} [had]{strong=“G2192” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 11”} [great]{strong=“G4183” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Apn\sc* 13”} [possessions]{strong=“G2933” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Apn\sc* 12”}. 
\p
\v 23 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [looked round about]{strong=“G4017” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Amp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”}, [and saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 5”} [unto]{strong=“G3588 G3101” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dpm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dpm\sc* 6 7”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 8”} [disciples]{strong=“G3101” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Dpm\sc* 7”}, \wj How hardly shall they that have riches enter into the kingdom of God!\wj* 
\v 24 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [the disciples]{strong=“G3101” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 3”} [were astonished]{strong=“G2284” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ipi\sc*-3P 4”} [at]{strong=“G1909” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 5”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 8”} [words]{strong=“G3588 G3056” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dpm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dpm\sc* 6 7”}. [But]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 10”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 11”} [answereth]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 13”} [again]{strong=“G3825” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 12”}, [and saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 14”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 15”}, \wj Children, how hard is it for them that trust in riches to enter into the kingdom of God!\wj* 
\v 25 \wj It is easier for a camel to go through the eye of a needle, than for a rich man to enter into the kingdom of God.\wj* 
\v 26 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [they were astonished]{strong=“G1605” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ipi\sc*-3P 4”} [out of measure]{strong=“G4057” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 3”}, [saying]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 5”} [among]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 6”} [themselves]{strong=“G1438” x-morph=“robinson: F-3\sc Apm\sc* 7”}, [Who]{strong=“G5101” x-morph=“robinson: I-\sc Nsm\sc* 9”} [then]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 8”} [can]{strong=“G1410” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pni\sc*-3S 10”} [be saved]{strong=“G4982” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Apn\sc* 11”}? 
\v 27 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 4 5”} [looking upon]{strong=“G1689” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 3”} [saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 6”}, \wj With men it is impossible, but not with God: for with God all things are possible.\wj* 
\p
\v 28 [Then]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Peter]{strong=“G3588 G4074” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [began]{strong=“G756” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 2”} [to say]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 5”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 6”}, [Lo]{strong=“G2400” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aam\sc*-2S 7”}, [we]{strong=“G2249” x-morph=“robinson: P-1\sc Np\sc* 8”} [have left]{strong=“G863” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-1S 9”} [all]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Apn\sc* 10”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 11”} [have followed]{strong=“G190” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-1P 12”} [thee]{strong=“G4671” x-morph=“robinson: P-2\sc Ds\sc* 13”}. 
\v 29 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} [and said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”}, \wj Verily I say unto you, There is no man that hath left house, or brethren, or sisters, or father, or mother, or wife, or children, or lands, for my sake, and the gospel’s,\wj* 
\v 30 \wj But he shall receive an hundredfold now in this time, houses, and brethren, and sisters, and mothers, and children, and lands, with persecutions; and in the world to come eternal life.\wj* 
\v 31 \wj But many that are first shall be last; and the last first.\wj* 
\p
\v 32 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [they were]{strong=“G2258” x-morph=“robinson: V-IXI-3P 1”} [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 3”} [the way]{strong=“G3588 G3598” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsf\sc* 4 5”} [going up]{strong=“G305” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 6”} [to]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 7”} [Jerusalem]{strong=“G2414” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 8”}; [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 9”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 13 14”} [went before]{strong=“G4254” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 11”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apm\sc* 12”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 15”} [they were amazed]{strong=“G2284” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ipi\sc*-3P 16”}; [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 17”} [as they followed]{strong=“G190” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 18”}, [they were afraid]{strong=“G5399” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ini\sc*-3P 19”}. [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 20”} [he took]{strong=“G3880” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 21”} [again]{strong=“G3825” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 22”} [the twelve]{strong=“G1427” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 24”}, [and began]{strong=“G756” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 25”} [to tell]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 27”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 26”} [what things should]{strong=“G3195” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Apn\sc* 29”} [happen]{strong=“G4819” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 31”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 30”}, 
\v 33 Saying, \wj Behold, we go up to Jerusalem; and the Son of man shall be delivered unto the chief priests, and unto the scribes; and they shall condemn him to death, and shall deliver him to the Gentiles:\wj* 
\v 34 \wj And they shall mock him, and shall scourge him, and shall spit upon him, and shall kill him: and the third day he shall rise again.\wj* 
\p
\v 35 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [James]{strong=“G2385” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 4”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 5”} [John]{strong=“G2491” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 6”}, [the sons]{strong=“G3588 G5207” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 7 8”} [of Zebedee]{strong=“G2199” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 9”}, [come unto]{strong=“G4365” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pni\sc*-3P 2”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 3”}, [saying]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 10”}, [Master]{strong=“G1320” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Vsm\sc* 11”}, [we would]{strong=“G2309” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-1P 12”} [that]{strong=“G2443” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 13”} [thou shouldest do]{strong=“G4160” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aas\sc*-2S 17”} [for us]{strong=“G2254” x-morph=“robinson: P-1\sc Dp\sc* 18”} [whatsoever]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Asn\sc* 14”} [we shall desire]{strong=“G154” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aas\sc*-1P 16”}. 
\v 36 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 3”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 4”}, \wj What would ye that I should do for you?\wj* 
\v 37 [They said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3P 3”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 4”}, [Grant]{strong=“G1325” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aam\sc*-2S 5”} [unto us]{strong=“G2254” x-morph=“robinson: P-1\sc Dp\sc* 6”} [that]{strong=“G2443” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 7”} [we may sit]{strong=“G2523” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aas\sc*-1P 17”}, [one]{strong=“G1520” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 8”} [on]{strong=“G1537” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 9”} [thy]{strong=“G4675” x-morph=“robinson: P-2\sc Gs\sc* 11”} [right hand]{strong=“G1188” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gpm\sc* 10”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 12”} [the other]{strong=“G1520” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 13”} [on]{strong=“G1537” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 14”} [thy]{strong=“G4675” x-morph=“robinson: P-2\sc Gs\sc* 16”} [left hand]{strong=“G2176” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gpm\sc* 15”}, [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 18”} [thy]{strong=“G4675” x-morph=“robinson: P-2\sc Gs\sc* 21”} [glory]{strong=“G3588 G1391” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsf\sc* 19 20”}. 
\v 38 [But]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 4”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 5”}, \wj Ye know not what ye ask: can ye drink of the cup that I drink of? and be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with?\wj* 
\v 39 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [they said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3P 3”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 4”}, [We can]{strong=“G1410” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pni\sc*-1P 5”}. [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 7”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 8”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 9”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 10”}, \wj Ye shall indeed drink of the cup that I drink of; and with the baptism that I am baptized withal shall ye be baptized:\wj* 
\v 40 \wj But to sit on my right hand and on my left hand is not mine to give; but it shall be given to them for whom it is prepared.\wj* 
\v 41 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [when]{strong=“G191” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 2”} [the ten]{strong=“G1176” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 4”} [heard]{strong=“G191” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 2”} it, [they began]{strong=“G756” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3P 5”} [to be much displeased]{strong=“G23” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 6”} [with]{strong=“G4012” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 7”} [James]{strong=“G2385” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 8”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 9”} [John]{strong=“G2491” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 10”}. 
\v 42 [But]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [called]{strong=“G4341” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 4”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apm\sc* 5”} to him, [and saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 6”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 7”}, \wj Ye know that they which are accounted to rule over the Gentiles exercise lordship over them; and their great ones exercise authority upon them.\wj* 
\v 43 \wj But so shall it not be among you: but whosoever will be great among you, shall be your minister:\wj* 
\v 44 \wj And whosoever of you will be the chiefest, shall be servant of all.\wj* 
\v 45 \wj For even the Son of man came not to be ministered unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for many.\wj* 
\p
