\v 51 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 5 6”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [and said]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 3”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 4”}, \wj What wilt thou that I should do unto thee?\wj* [The blind man]{strong=“G5185” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 13”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 14”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 15”}, [Lord]{strong=“G4462” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Aram\sc* 16”}, [that]{strong=“G2443” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 17”} [I might receive my sight]{strong=“G308” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aas\sc*-1S 18”}. 
