\v 17 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he taught]{strong=“G1321” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 2”}, [saying]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 4”}, \wj Is it not written, My house shall be called of all nations the house of prayer? but ye have made it a den of thieves.\wj* 
