\v 24 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [answering]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 6”}, \wj Do ye not therefore err, because ye know not the scriptures, neither the power of God?\wj* 
\v 25 \wj For when they shall rise from the dead, they neither marry, nor are given in marriage; but are as the angels which are in heaven.\wj* 
\v 26 \wj And as touching the dead, that they rise: have ye not read in the book of Moses, how in the bush God spake unto him, saying, I am the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob?\wj* 
\v 27 \wj He is not the God of the dead, but the God of the living: ye therefore do greatly err.\wj* 
\p
