\v 29 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 4”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 5”}, \wj The first of all the commandments is, Hear, O Israel; The Lord our God is one Lord:\wj* 
\v 30 \wj And thou shalt love the Lord thy God with all thy heart, and with all thy soul, and with all thy mind, and with all thy strength: this is the first commandment.\wj* 
\v 31 \wj And the second is like, namely this, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself. There is none other commandment greater than these.\wj* 
\v 32 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [the scribe]{strong=“G3588 G1122” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 4 5”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 2”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 3”}, [Well]{strong=“G2573” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 6”}, [Master]{strong=“G1320” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Vsm\sc* 7”}, [thou hast said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-2S 10”} [the truth]{strong=“G225” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 9”}: [for]{strong=“G3754” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 11”} [there is]{strong=“G2076” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxi\sc*-3S 13”} [one]{strong=“G1520” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 12”} [God]{strong=“G2316” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 14”}; [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 15”} [there is]{strong=“G2076” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxi\sc*-3S 17”} [none]{strong=“G3756” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prt\sc*-N 16”} [other]{strong=“G243” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 18”} [but]{strong=“G4133” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 19”} [he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 20”}: 
\v 33 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [to love]{strong=“G25” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 3”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 4”} [with]{strong=“G1537” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 5”} [all]{strong=“G3650” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsf\sc* 6”} [the heart]{strong=“G3588 G2588” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 7 8”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 9”} [with]{strong=“G1537” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 10”} [all]{strong=“G3650” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsf\sc* 11”} [the understanding]{strong=“G3588 G4907” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 12 13”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 14”} [with]{strong=“G1537” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 15”} [all]{strong=“G3650” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsf\sc* 16”} [the soul]{strong=“G3588 G5590” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 17 18”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 19”} [with]{strong=“G1537” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 20”} [all]{strong=“G3650” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsf\sc* 21”} [the strength]{strong=“G3588 G2479” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 22 23”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 24”} [to love]{strong=“G25” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 26”} his [neighbour]{strong=“G4139” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 28”} [as]{strong=“G5613” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 29”} [himself]{strong=“G1438” x-morph=“robinson: F-3\sc Asm\sc* 30”}, [is]{strong=“G2076” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxi\sc*-3S 32”} [more]{strong=“G4119” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsn\sc*-C 31”} [than all]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gpn\sc* 33”} [whole burnt offerings]{strong=“G3588 G3646” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gpn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gpn\sc* 34 35”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 36”} [sacrifices]{strong=“G3588 G2378” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gpf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gpf\sc* 37 38”}. 
\v 34 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [when Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 2 3”} [saw]{strong=“G1492” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 4”} [that]{strong=“G3754” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 6”} [he answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 8”} [discreetly]{strong=“G3562” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 7”}, [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 9”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 10”}, \wj Thou art not far from the kingdom of God.\wj* [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 19”} [no man]{strong=“G3762” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 20”} [after that]{strong=“G3765” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 21”} [durst]{strong=“G5111” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 22”} [ask]{strong=“G1905” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aan\sc* 24”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 23”} any question. 
\p
\v 35 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [and said]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 5”}, [while he taught]{strong=“G1321” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 6”} [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 7”} [the temple]{strong=“G3588 G2411” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsn\sc* 8 9”}, \wj How say the scribes that Christ is the Son of David?\wj* 
\v 36 \sc For David himself said by the Holy Ghost, The \wj Lord\sc* said to my Lord, Sit thou on my right hand, till I make thine enemies thy footstool.\wj* 
\v 37 \wj David therefore himself calleth him Lord; and whence is he then his son? And the common people heard him gladly.\wj* 
\p
\v 38 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he said]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 2”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 3”} [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 7”} [doctrine]{strong=“G3588 G1322” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsf\sc* 5 6”}, \wj Beware of the scribes, which love to go in long clothing, and love salutations in the marketplaces,\wj* 
\v 39 \wj And the chief seats in the synagogues, and the uppermost rooms at feasts:\wj* 
\v 40 \wj Which devour widows’ houses, and for a pretence make long prayers: these shall receive greater damnation.\wj* 
\p
\v 41 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [sat]{strong=“G2523” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [over against]{strong=“G2713” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 5”} [the treasury]{strong=“G3588 G1049” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsn\sc* 6 7”}, [and beheld]{strong=“G2334” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 8”} [how]{strong=“G4459” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 9”} [the people]{strong=“G3588 G3793” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 10 11”} [cast]{strong=“G906” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 12”} [money]{strong=“G5475” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 13”} [into]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 14”} [the treasury]{strong=“G3588 G1049” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asn\sc* 15 16”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 17”} [many]{strong=“G4183” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Npm\sc* 18”} [that were rich]{strong=“G4145” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Npm\sc* 19”} [cast]{strong=“G906” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 20”} [in much]{strong=“G4183” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Apn\sc* 21”}. 
\v 42 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [there came]{strong=“G2064” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsf\sc* 2”} [a certain]{strong=“G1520” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsf\sc* 3”} [poor]{strong=“G4434” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsf\sc* 5”} [widow]{strong=“G5503” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 4”}, [and she threw in]{strong=“G906” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 6”} [two]{strong=“G1417” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 8”} [mites]{strong=“G3016” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Apn\sc* 7”}, [which]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Nsn\sc* 9”} [make]{strong=“G2076” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxi\sc*-3S 10”} [a farthing]{strong=“G2835” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 11”}. 
\v 43 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he called]{strong=“G4341” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} unto him [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 5”} [disciples]{strong=“G3588 G3101” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Apm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Apm\sc* 3 4”}, [and saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 6”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 7”}, \wj Verily I say unto you, That this poor widow hath cast more in, than all they which have cast into the treasury:\wj* 
\v 44 \wj For all they did cast in of their abundance; but she of her want did cast in all that she had, even all her living.\wj* 
\c 13
\p 
\v 1 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [as he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 3”} [went out]{strong=“G1607” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pnp\sc*-\sc Gsm\sc* 2”} [of]{strong=“G1537” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [the temple]{strong=“G3588 G2411” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsn\sc* 5 6”}, [one]{strong=“G1520” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 9”} [of his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 12”} [disciples]{strong=“G3588 G3101” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gpm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gpm\sc* 10 11”} [saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 7”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 8”}, [Master]{strong=“G1320” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Vsm\sc* 13”}, [see]{strong=“G1492” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aam\sc*-2S 14”} [what manner of]{strong=“G4217” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Npm\sc* 15”} [stones]{strong=“G3037” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 16”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 17”} [what]{strong=“G4217” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Npf\sc* 18”} [buildings]{strong=“G3619” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Npf\sc* 19”} are here! 
\v 2 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 2 3”} [answering]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 4”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 6”}, \wj Seest thou these great buildings? there shall not be left one stone upon another, that shall not be thrown down.\wj* 
\v 3 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [as he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 3”} [sat]{strong=“G2521” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pnp\sc*-\sc Gsm\sc* 2”} [upon]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [the mount]{strong=“G3588 G3735” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asn\sc* 5 6”} [of Olives]{strong=“G3588 G1636” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gpf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gpf\sc* 7 8”} [over against]{strong=“G2713” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 9”} [the temple]{strong=“G3588 G2411” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsn\sc* 10 11”}, [Peter]{strong=“G4074” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 16”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 17”} [James]{strong=“G2385” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 18”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 19”} [John]{strong=“G2491” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 20”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 21”} [Andrew]{strong=“G406” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 22”} [asked]{strong=“G1905” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 12”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 13”} [privately]{strong=“G2398” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Asf\sc* 15”}, 
\v 4 [Tell]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aam\sc*-2S 1”} [us]{strong=“G2254” x-morph=“robinson: P-1\sc Dp\sc* 2”}, [when]{strong=“G4219” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prt\sc*-I 3”} [shall]{strong=“G2071” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Fxi\sc*-3S 5”} [these things]{strong=“G5023” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Npn\sc* 4”} [be]{strong=“G2071” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Fxi\sc*-3S 5”}? [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 6”} [what]{strong=“G5101” x-morph=“robinson: I-\sc Nsn\sc* 7”} shall be [the sign]{strong=“G3588 G4592” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsn\sc* 8 9”} [when]{strong=“G3752” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 10”} [all]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Apn\sc* 12”} [these things]{strong=“G5023” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Apn\sc* 13”} [shall be fulfilled]{strong=“G4931” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ppn\sc* 14”}? 
\v 5 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [answering]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 4”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 5”} [began]{strong=“G756” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 6”} [to say]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 7”}, \wj Take heed lest any man deceive you:\wj* 
\v 6 \wj For many shall come in my name, saying, I am Christ; and shall deceive many.\wj* 
\v 7 \wj And when ye shall hear of wars and rumours of wars, be ye not troubled: for such things must needs be; but the end shall not be yet.\wj* 
\v 8 \wj For nation shall rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom: and there shall be earthquakes in divers places, and there shall be famines and troubles: these are the beginnings of sorrows.\wj* 
\p
\v 9 \wj But take heed to yourselves: for they shall deliver you up to councils; and in the synagogues ye shall be beaten: and ye shall be brought before rulers and kings for my sake, for a testimony against them.\wj* 
\v 10 \wj And the gospel must first be published among all nations.\wj* 
\v 11 \wj But when they shall lead you, and deliver you up, take no thought beforehand what ye shall speak, neither do ye premeditate: but whatsoever shall be given you in that hour, that speak ye: for it is not ye that speak, but the Holy Ghost.\wj* 
\v 12 \wj Now the brother shall betray the brother to death, and the father the son; and children shall rise up against their parents, and shall cause them to be put to death.\wj* 
\v 13 \wj And ye shall be hated of all men for my name’s sake: but he that shall endure unto the end, the same shall be saved.\wj* 
\p
\v 14 \wj But when ye shall see the abomination of desolation, spoken of by Daniel the prophet, standing where it ought not, (let him that readeth understand,) then let them that be in Judæa flee to the mountains:\wj* 
\v 15 \wj And let him that is on the housetop not go down into the house, neither enter therein, to take any thing out of his house:\wj* 
\v 16 \wj And let him that is in the field not turn back again for to take up his garment.\wj* 
\v 17 \wj But woe to them that are with child, and to them that give suck in those days!\wj* 
\v 18 \wj And pray ye that your flight be not in the winter.\wj* 
\v 19 \wj For in those days shall be affliction, such as was not from the beginning of the creation which God created unto this time, neither shall be.\wj* 
\v 20 \wj And except that the Lord had shortened those days, no flesh should be saved: but for the elect’s sake, whom he hath chosen, he hath shortened the days.\wj* 
\v 21 \wj And then if any man shall say to you, Lo, here is Christ; or, lo, he is there; believe him not:\wj* 
\v 22 \wj For false Christs and false prophets shall rise, and shall shew signs and wonders, to seduce, if it were possible, even the elect.\wj* 
\v 23 \wj But take ye heed: behold, I have foretold you all things.\wj* 
\p
\v 24 \wj But in those days, after that tribulation, the sun shall be darkened, and the moon shall not give her light,\wj* 
\v 25 \wj And the stars of heaven shall fall, and the powers that are in heaven shall be shaken.\wj* 
\v 26 \wj And then shall they see the Son of man coming in the clouds with great power and glory.\wj* 
\v 27 \wj And then shall he send his angels, and shall gather together his elect from the four winds, from the uttermost part of the earth to the uttermost part of heaven.\wj* 
\v 28 \wj Now learn a parable of the fig tree; When her branch is yet tender, and putteth forth leaves, ye know that summer is near:\wj* 
\v 29 \wj So ye in like manner, when ye shall see these things come to pass, know that it is nigh, even at the doors.\wj* 
\v 30 \wj Verily I say unto you, that this generation shall not pass, till all these things be done.\wj* 
\v 31 \wj Heaven and earth shall pass away: but my words shall not pass away.\wj* 
\p
\v 32 \wj But of that day and that hour knoweth no man, no, not the angels which are in heaven, neither the Son, but the Father.\wj* 
\v 33 \wj Take ye heed, watch and pray: for ye know not when the time is.\wj* 
\v 34 \wj For the Son of man is as a man taking a far journey, who left his house, and gave authority to his servants, and to every man his work, and commanded the porter to watch.\wj* 
\v 35 \wj Watch ye therefore: for ye know not when the master of the house cometh, at even, or at midnight, or at the cockcrowing, or in the morning:\wj* 
\v 36 \wj Lest coming suddenly he find you sleeping.\wj* 
\v 37 \wj And what I say unto you I say unto all, Watch.\wj* 
\c 14
\p 
\v 1 [After]{strong=“G3326” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 8”} [two]{strong=“G1417” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 9”} [days]{strong=“G2250” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Apf\sc* 10”} [was]{strong=“G2258” x-morph=“robinson: V-IXI-3S 1”} the feast of [the passover]{strong=“G3957” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Aram\sc* 4”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 5”} [of unleavened bread]{strong=“G106” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Npn\sc* 7”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 11”} [the chief priests]{strong=“G3588 G749” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 13 14”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 15”} [the scribes]{strong=“G3588 G1122” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 16 17”} [sought]{strong=“G2212” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 12”} [how]{strong=“G4459” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc*-I 18”} [they might take]{strong=“G2902” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 22”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 19”} [by]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 20”} [craft]{strong=“G1388” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Dsm\sc* 21”}, [and put]{strong=“G615” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pas\sc*-3P 23”} him [to death]{strong=“G615” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pas\sc*-3P 23”}. 
\v 2 [But]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [they said]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 1”}, [Not]{strong=“G3361” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prt\sc*-N 3”} [on]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [the feast]{strong=“G3588 G1859” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsf\sc* 5 6”} day, [lest]{strong=“G3379” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 7”} [there be]{strong=“G2071” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Fxi\sc*-3S 9”} [an uproar]{strong=“G2351” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 8”} [of the people]{strong=“G3588 G2992” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 10 11”}. 
\p
\v 3 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [being]{strong=“G5607” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxp\sc*-\sc Gsm\sc* 2”} [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [Bethany]{strong=“G963” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Dsf\sc* 5”} [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 6”} [the house]{strong=“G3588 G3614” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsf\sc* 7 8”} [of Simon]{strong=“G4613” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 9”} [the leper]{strong=“G3015” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsm\sc* 11”}, [as he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 13”} [sat at meat]{strong=“G2621” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pnp\sc*-\sc Gsm\sc* 12”}, [there came]{strong=“G2064” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 14”} [a woman]{strong=“G1135” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 15”} [having]{strong=“G2192” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsf\sc* 16”} [an alabaster box]{strong=“G211” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asn\sc* 17”} [of ointment]{strong=“G3464” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsn\sc* 18”} [of spikenard]{strong=“G3487” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 19”} [very precious]{strong=“G4185” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsf\sc* 21”}; [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 22”} [she brake]{strong=“G4937” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsf\sc* 23”} [the box]{strong=“G3588 G211” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asn\sc* 24 25”}, [and poured]{strong=“G2708” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 26”} it [on]{strong=“G2596” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 28”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsn\sc* 27”} [head]{strong=“G3588 G2776” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 29 30”}. 
