\v 15 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 2”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 3”}, \wj Go ye into all the world, and preach the gospel to every creature.\wj* 
\v 16 \wj He that believeth and is baptized shall be saved; but he that believeth not shall be damned.\wj* 
\v 17 \wj And these signs shall follow them that believe; In my name shall they cast out devils; they shall speak with new tongues;\wj* 
\v 18 \wj They shall take up serpents; and if they drink any deadly thing, it shall not hurt them; they shall lay hands on the sick, and they shall recover.\wj* 
\p
